(
    title: "Synthcart",
    kind: Tool,
    developer: Some("Paul Slocum"),
    description: Some("Turns the console into a basic synthesiser: each of the two keypads drives one oscillator, with an arpeggiator at eighth, sixteenth and thirty-second notes, a beat box of preset rhythms that can be layered two at a time, tremolo and attack/release settings. The interface is designed to be usable without a television."),
